{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBさん、発売中です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット載っけます(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘です（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じくUTBさんには、純奈も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載ってるので、ぜひぜひ見てねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ 中国シリーズ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事千秋楽を迎えられました～( *ˆoˆ* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご来場くださった皆さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難うございました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京から遠く離れた場所で、沢山の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お客さんが集まってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山口県では立ち見席までお客さんが入ってくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信じられない(*_*)感謝でいっぱい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマは「表現力の向上」ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"派手なセットが一切ない素舞台で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がどこまでできるのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく勉強になった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり舞台に立つことが好きだし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芝居でもなんでも、全身で何かを表現するのって楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと色んな表現力を身につけたいと思ったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう機会を与えて頂き、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくすごく糧になったライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただこのライブには、皆が色んな思いを抱えて望んでいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アンダー」という言葉にはとても残酷な意味があるように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい楽しいって気持ちだけじゃないのも事実。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thでアンダーライブが開催されると聞いた時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても嬉しかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに出るということが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どういう意味があるのか考えたときに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜びとはちょっと違って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし負けないぞ、やってやるぞ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう気持ちのほうが強かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前を向いて、強く気を張って、ステージに立とうと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で今回のライブに望みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中途中にあったパフォーマンスにも色んな物語が込められていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを噛み締めながら披露させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セットリストの中にも、「マネキン」から始まって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことを経て、最後には、一人ひとりが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か「きっかけ」を掴んで、歩いて行けるようにという"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出家さんの思いがすごく込められていたし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフォーマンスの中で、万理華と抱き合う振り付けや、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈ちゃんの背中を押す振り付けもあったりして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何より今回初センターの日奈ちゃんや、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初フロントのみりあが隣にいてくれたことに、そのポジションでの自分の責任もすごく感じていたし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りを支えることに、まだまだな自分にも葛藤していて...とにかく色んな感情があったわけです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも3日間を通して、本当に楽しかったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったなあって心から思えました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駆け付けて下さったお客さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちの為に沢山支えて下さったスタッフの皆さん、演出を付けてくださった先生方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつでも優しくて楽しくて、一緒に泣いたり笑ったりしてくれるメンバーのみんな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に本当に有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもだからこそ、こうして学んだことを、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過ごした時間を、絶対無駄にはしたくないな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと次に繋げれるように頑張らなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、個別握手会でした**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さった皆さん、有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎私服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/26/8778324/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blo